<title>POLAND: Vistula Q2 net rises to PLN 3.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Vistula Q2 net rises to PLN 3.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vistula SA preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     4.14   vs    2.97</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 4.99   vs    4.07</p>
<p>    net profit			     3.35   vs    1.87</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Vistula SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     31.29   vs   22.95</p>
<p>Transmission was aborted</p>
</text>
